<h1>AMI Generator</h1>
This module is used to generate the AMI files required for the AMI Loader module to function.
The script is made to make sure the AMI can be updated easily and quickly.

<h2>Recipe</h2>
At first I needed to install Packer.

```
    # macOS
   brew install packer

   # Ubuntu / Debian
   sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install -y packer
```